# The ar5iv-css release whose dist/ar5iv.min.css release builds embed as the bundled `ar5iv.css`
# (docs/release/RELEASING.md "The bundled ar5iv.css"). Read by tools/fetch_ar5iv_css.sh, which fetches the file at
